{"id":"n79399-1-10","stage":2,"title":"주먹 · 拳头","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n79399-1-10-1","ko":"아기가 너무 귀엽다.","zh":"宝宝太可爱了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아기가","meaning":"小孩，婴儿","explanation":"아기：小孩，婴儿；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아기","audio":"/audio/d5fa7c0faafdc9fccb16.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20235","senseId":"1","lemma":"아기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"귀엽다.","meaning":"可爱","explanation":"귀엽다：可爱；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"귀엽다","audio":"/audio/f6866c147cb407d922da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38323","senseId":"1","lemma":"귀엽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d5fa7c0faafdc9fc","term":"아기","zh":"小孩，婴儿","audio":"/audio/d5fa7c0faafdc9fccb16.mp3","entryId":"20235","definition":"吃着奶的非常幼小的孩子。","pronunciation":["아기"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"f6866c147cb407d9","term":"귀엽다","zh":"可爱","audio":"/audio/f6866c147cb407d922da.mp3","entryId":"38323","definition":"看起来漂亮，或令人喜爱。","pronunciation":["귀ː엽따"]}],"audio":"/audio/61a4454e5a5d18607ab2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n79399-1-10-2","ko":"손이 작아서 그런지 주먹도 너무 작고 귀엽네.","zh":"因为手很小，所以拳头也特别小，很可爱呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"손이","meaning":"手","explanation":"손：手；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"손","audio":"/audio/27d4fa6af704520dcfd6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17608","senseId":"1","lemma":"손","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"작아서","meaning":"小， 矮","explanation":"작다：小， 矮；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"작다","audio":"/audio/bc42f85bf5be37c92f7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69513","senseId":"1","lemma":"작다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그런지","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；ㄴ지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주먹도","meaning":"拳头","explanation":"주먹：拳头；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"주먹","audio":"/audio/185cb776662b98cf534c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79399","senseId":"1","lemma":"주먹","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"작고","meaning":"小， 矮","explanation":"작다：小， 矮；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"작다","audio":"/audio/bc42f85bf5be37c92f7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69513","senseId":"1","lemma":"작다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"귀엽네.","meaning":"可爱","explanation":"귀엽다：可爱；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"귀엽다","audio":"/audio/f6866c147cb407d922da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38323","senseId":"1","lemma":"귀엽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"27d4fa6af704520d","term":"손","zh":"手","audio":"/audio/27d4fa6af704520dcfd6.mp3","entryId":"17608","definition":"位于手腕的末端，用于摸某物或抓某物时使用的肢体中一部分。","pronunciation":["손"]},{"id":"bc42f85bf5be37c9","term":"작다","zh":"小， 矮","audio":"/audio/bc42f85bf5be37c92f7c.mp3","entryId":"69513","definition":"长度、宽度、体积等少于其他或一般尺寸。","pronunciation":["작ː따"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"185cb776662b98cf","term":"주먹","zh":"拳头","audio":"/audio/185cb776662b98cf534c.mp3","entryId":"79399","definition":"卷屈所有手指而握住的手。","pronunciation":["주먹"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","ter